{"seq":1,"slug":"profiling-tools","title":"性能分析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-performance/profiling-tools","wordCount":1119,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能分析工具\">性能分析工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能优化的第一原则是&quot;先测量，后优化&quot;。Unity 提供了一套完整的性能分析工具链，从 CPU/GPU 耗时分析到内存快照、从帧调试到物理诊断，覆盖了游戏开发中所有需要关注的性能维度。正确使用这些工具定位瓶颈，比盲目优化代码要高效得多。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Unity 性能工具链&#10;        A[Profiler] --&gt; B[CPU 模块]&#10;        A --&gt; C[GPU 模块]&#10;        A --&gt; D[Memory 模块]&#10;        A --&gt; E[Rendering 模块]&#10;        A --&gt; F[Physics 模块]&#10;        G[Frame Debugger] --&gt; H[Draw Call 分析]&#10;        I[Memory Profiler] --&gt; J[内存快照对比]&#10;        K[Profile Analyzer] --&gt; L[多帧统计分析]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; M[方法耗时定位]&#10;    D --&gt; N[内存泄漏检测]&#10;    H --&gt; O[批处理优化]\">graph TD\n    subgraph Unity 性能工具链\n        A[Profiler] --&gt; B[CPU 模块]\n        A --&gt; C[GPU 模块]\n        A --&gt; D[Memory 模块]\n        A --&gt; E[Rendering 模块]\n        A --&gt; F[Physics 模块]\n        G[Frame Debugger] --&gt; H[Draw Call 分析]\n        I[Memory Profiler] --&gt; J[内存快照对比]\n        K[Profile Analyzer] --&gt; L[多帧统计分析]\n    end\n    B --&gt; M[方法耗时定位]\n    D --&gt; N[内存泄漏检测]\n    H --&gt; O[批处理优化]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>核心用途</th>\n<th>分析维度</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Profiler (CPU)</td>\n<td>方法级耗时分析</td>\n<td>CPU 时间</td>\n<td>定位卡顿帧的热点方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Profiler (GPU)</td>\n<td>渲染管线耗时</td>\n<td>GPU 时间</td>\n<td>定位渲染瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Profiler (Memory)</td>\n<td>内存分配追踪</td>\n<td>堆内存/GC</td>\n<td>检测内存泄漏和 GC 峰值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frame Debugger</td>\n<td>Draw Call 逐步分析</td>\n<td>渲染批次</td>\n<td>优化批处理和材质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Memory Profiler</td>\n<td>内存快照与对比</td>\n<td>对象级内存</td>\n<td>精确定位内存占用源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Profile Analyzer</td>\n<td>多帧数据统计</td>\n<td>统计分布</td>\n<td>长时间性能趋势分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Physics Debugger</td>\n<td>碰撞体可视化</td>\n<td>物理开销</td>\n<td>调试碰撞检测问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"profiler-cpu-模块\">Profiler CPU 模块</h2><p>CPU Profiler 是最常用的性能分析工具，它以时间轴和层级树两种视图展示每帧中所有方法的执行耗时。通过 Profiler 可以精确定位哪个脚本的哪个方法消耗了最多的 CPU 时间。</p>\n<p>Profiler 支持编辑器内分析和真机远程分析。编辑器内分析存在额外开销，真机分析才能反映真实性能。通过 Build Settings 中启用 Development Build 和 Autoconnect Profiler，可以在真机启动时自动连接 Profiler。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.Profiling;&#10;&#10;public class ProfilerExample : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        Profiler.BeginSample(&quot;AI Decision&quot;);&#10;        MakeAIDecision();&#10;        Profiler.EndSample();&#10;&#10;        Profiler.BeginSample(&quot;Path Finding&quot;);&#10;        CalculatePath();&#10;        Profiler.EndSample();&#10;&#10;        Profiler.BeginSample(&quot;Animation Update&quot;);&#10;        UpdateAnimations();&#10;        Profiler.EndSample();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void MakeAIDecision()&#10;    {&#10;        System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(1);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void CalculatePath()&#10;    {&#10;        System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(2);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void UpdateAnimations()&#10;    {&#10;        System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(1);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.Profiling;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ProfilerExample : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.BeginSample(\"AI Decision\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MakeAIDecision();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.EndSample();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.BeginSample(\"Path Finding\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CalculatePath();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.EndSample();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.BeginSample(\"Animation Update\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UpdateAnimations();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.EndSample();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void MakeAIDecision()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void CalculatePath()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void UpdateAnimations()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Profiler.BeginSample</code> / <code>Profiler.EndSample</code> 在 Profiler 的层级树中创建自定义标记，让开发者可以清楚看到每段逻辑的耗时。在发布版本中这些调用会被自动剥离，不产生运行时开销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Profiler 视图</th>\n<th>显示方式</th>\n<th>适用分析</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Timeline</td>\n<td>时间线色块</td>\n<td>多线程并行分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hierarchy</td>\n<td>层级树 + 耗时排序</td>\n<td>定位单帧热点方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Raw Hierarchy</td>\n<td>不合并同名调用</td>\n<td>区分多次调用的各自耗时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>重点关注的指标：<code>Total</code>（含子调用的总耗时）和 <code>Self</code>（排除子调用的自身耗时）。<code>Self</code> 高说明方法本身有性能问题，<code>Total</code> 高但 <code>Self</code> 低说明问题在子方法中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"profiler-memory-与-gc-分析\">Profiler Memory 与 GC 分析</h2><p>Memory 模块追踪堆内存的分配和回收。Unity 使用增量式垃圾回收（Incremental GC），但 GC 仍然会造成帧率波动。Memory 模块帮助识别哪些代码在运行时频繁分配堆内存。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph GC 分配追踪&#10;        A[每帧分配量] --&gt; B{超过阈值}&#10;        B --&gt;|是| C[触发 GC]&#10;        C --&gt; D[帧率卡顿]&#10;        B --&gt;|否| E[正常运行]&#10;    end&#10;    F[Profiler Memory] --&gt; G[定位分配源]&#10;    G --&gt; H[优化代码]&#10;    H --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    subgraph GC 分配追踪\n        A[每帧分配量] --&gt; B{超过阈值}\n        B --&gt;|是| C[触发 GC]\n        C --&gt; D[帧率卡顿]\n        B --&gt;|否| E[正常运行]\n    end\n    F[Profiler Memory] --&gt; G[定位分配源]\n    G --&gt; H[优化代码]\n    H --&gt; E</pre><p>常见的 GC 分配陷阱和优化方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;using System.Text;&#10;&#10;public class GCOptimizationExamples : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private readonly List&lt;Collider&gt; hitResults = new(32);&#10;    private readonly Collider[] overlapBuffer = new Collider[64];&#10;    private readonly StringBuilder textBuilder = new(128);&#10;    private readonly RaycastHit[] raycastBuffer = new RaycastHit[16];&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        CheckNearbyEnemies();&#10;        UpdateDisplayText();&#10;        PerformRaycast();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void CheckNearbyEnemies()&#10;    {&#10;        int count = Physics.OverlapSphereNonAlloc(&#10;            transform.position, 10f, overlapBuffer&#10;        );&#10;&#10;        hitResults.Clear();&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; count; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            if (overlapBuffer[i].CompareTag(&quot;Enemy&quot;))&#10;            {&#10;                hitResults.Add(overlapBuffer[i]);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void UpdateDisplayText()&#10;    {&#10;        textBuilder.Clear();&#10;        textBuilder.Append(&quot;HP: &quot;);&#10;        textBuilder.Append(100);&#10;        textBuilder.Append(&quot; / &quot;);&#10;        textBuilder.Append(100);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void PerformRaycast()&#10;    {&#10;        int hits = Physics.RaycastNonAlloc(&#10;            transform.position, transform.forward,&#10;            raycastBuffer, 100f&#10;        );&#10;&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; hits; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            ProcessHit(raycastBuffer[i]);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void ProcessHit(RaycastHit hit)&#10;    {&#10;        Debug.Log(hit.collider.name);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class GCOptimizationExamples : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly List&#x3C;Collider> hitResults = new(32);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly Collider[] overlapBuffer = new Collider[64];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly StringBuilder textBuilder = new(128);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly RaycastHit[] raycastBuffer = new RaycastHit[16];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CheckNearbyEnemies();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UpdateDisplayText();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PerformRaycast();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void CheckNearbyEnemies()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int count = Physics.OverlapSphereNonAlloc(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            transform.position, 10f, overlapBuffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        hitResults.Clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; count; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (overlapBuffer[i].CompareTag(\"Enemy\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                hitResults.Add(overlapBuffer[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void UpdateDisplayText()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        textBuilder.Clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        textBuilder.Append(\"HP: \");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        textBuilder.Append(100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        textBuilder.Append(\" / \");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        textBuilder.Append(100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void PerformRaycast()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int hits = Physics.RaycastNonAlloc(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            transform.position, transform.forward,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            raycastBuffer, 100f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; hits; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProcessHit(raycastBuffer[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void ProcessHit(RaycastHit hit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log(hit.collider.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GC 陷阱</th>\n<th>分配来源</th>\n<th>优化方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Physics.OverlapSphere</td>\n<td>返回新数组</td>\n<td>使用 NonAlloc 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>string 拼接</td>\n<td>每次创建新字符串</td>\n<td>StringBuilder 复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LINQ 查询</td>\n<td>迭代器和委托分配</td>\n<td>手写 for 循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>foreach 值类型集合</td>\n<td>装箱拆箱</td>\n<td>使用 for 循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GetComponent 每帧调用</td>\n<td>内部查找分配</td>\n<td>Awake 中缓存引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lambda 表达式</td>\n<td>闭包对象分配</td>\n<td>缓存委托或静态方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"frame-debugger-渲染分析\">Frame Debugger 渲染分析</h2><p>Frame Debugger 以逐步回放的方式展示当前帧的所有 Draw Call，让开发者清楚看到每个渲染批次绘制了什么、为什么与前一批次无法合并。这是优化 Draw Call 数量的核心工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.Rendering;&#10;&#10;public class RenderStatsMonitor : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private bool enableStatsOverlay;&#10;&#10;    private int lastBatchCount;&#10;    private int lastSetPassCalls;&#10;    private int lastTriangleCount;&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        if (!enableStatsOverlay) return;&#10;&#10;        int currentBatches = UnityEngine.Rendering.RenderPipelineManager&#10;            .currentPipeline != null ? 0 : 0;&#10;&#10;        RecordStats();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void RecordStats()&#10;    {&#10;        Profiler.BeginSample(&quot;Render Stats Collection&quot;);&#10;&#10;        int triangles = UnityStats.triangles;&#10;        int vertices = UnityStats.vertices;&#10;        int batches = UnityStats.batches;&#10;        int setPassCalls = UnityStats.setPassCalls;&#10;&#10;        if (batches != lastBatchCount || setPassCalls != lastSetPassCalls)&#10;        {&#10;            lastBatchCount = batches;&#10;            lastSetPassCalls = setPassCalls;&#10;            lastTriangleCount = triangles;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        Profiler.EndSample();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public string GetStatsReport()&#10;    {&#10;        return $&quot;Batches: {lastBatchCount}, &quot; +&#10;               $&quot;SetPass: {lastSetPassCalls}, &quot; +&#10;               $&quot;Tris: {lastTriangleCount}&quot;;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.Rendering;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class RenderStatsMonitor : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private bool enableStatsOverlay;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int lastBatchCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int lastSetPassCalls;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int lastTriangleCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!enableStatsOverlay) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int currentBatches = UnityEngine.Rendering.RenderPipelineManager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .currentPipeline != null ? 0 : 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        RecordStats();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void RecordStats()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.BeginSample(\"Render Stats Collection\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int triangles = UnityStats.triangles;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int vertices = UnityStats.vertices;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int batches = UnityStats.batches;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int setPassCalls = UnityStats.setPassCalls;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (batches != lastBatchCount || setPassCalls != lastSetPassCalls)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lastBatchCount = batches;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lastSetPassCalls = setPassCalls;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lastTriangleCount = triangles;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Profiler.EndSample();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string GetStatsReport()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return $\"Batches: {lastBatchCount}, \" +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               $\"SetPass: {lastSetPassCalls}, \" +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               $\"Tris: {lastTriangleCount}\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Frame Debugger 中的关键分析步骤：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 打开 Frame Debugger</td>\n<td>Window → Analysis</td>\n<td>暂停游戏后启用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 逐步浏览 Draw Call</td>\n<td>点击左侧列表</td>\n<td>观察每步绘制了什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 查看批次断裂原因</td>\n<td>右侧面板</td>\n<td>Why this draw call can&#39;t batch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 检查材质和纹理</td>\n<td>Shader/Material 信息</td>\n<td>是否可以统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 分析 Overdraw</td>\n<td>多层透明叠加</td>\n<td>是否存在过度绘制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自定义性能监控面板\">自定义性能监控面板</h2><p>在开发阶段创建一个实时性能监控面板，可以在运行时随时观察关键性能指标，无需每次打开 Profiler：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Text;&#10;&#10;public class PerformanceOverlay : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private bool showOverlay = true;&#10;    [SerializeField] private int fontSize = 14;&#10;&#10;    private float deltaTime;&#10;    private float updateInterval = 0.5f;&#10;    private float lastUpdateTime;&#10;    private int frameCount;&#10;    private float currentFPS;&#10;    private float minFPS = float.MaxValue;&#10;    private float maxFPS;&#10;    private readonly StringBuilder sb = new(256);&#10;&#10;    private GUIStyle style;&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        deltaTime += (Time.unscaledDeltaTime - deltaTime) * 0.1f;&#10;        frameCount++;&#10;&#10;        if (Time.unscaledTime - lastUpdateTime &gt;= updateInterval)&#10;        {&#10;            currentFPS = frameCount / (Time.unscaledTime - lastUpdateTime);&#10;            frameCount = 0;&#10;            lastUpdateTime = Time.unscaledTime;&#10;&#10;            if (currentFPS &lt; minFPS &amp;&amp; currentFPS &gt; 0) minFPS = currentFPS;&#10;            if (currentFPS &gt; maxFPS) maxFPS = currentFPS;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnGUI()&#10;    {&#10;        if (!showOverlay) return;&#10;&#10;        style ??= new GUIStyle(GUI.skin.label)&#10;        {&#10;            fontSize = fontSize,&#10;            fontStyle = FontStyle.Bold&#10;        };&#10;        style.normal.textColor = currentFPS &lt; 30 ? Color.red :&#10;                                  currentFPS &lt; 60 ? Color.yellow : Color.green;&#10;&#10;        float msec = deltaTime * 1000f;&#10;        long totalMemory = UnityEngine.Profiling.Profiler.GetTotalAllocatedMemoryLong();&#10;        long usedMemory = UnityEngine.Profiling.Profiler.GetTotalReservedMemoryLong();&#10;&#10;        sb.Clear();&#10;        sb.AppendLine($&quot;FPS: {currentFPS:F1} ({msec:F1}ms)&quot;);&#10;        sb.AppendLine($&quot;Min: {minFPS:F1} / Max: {maxFPS:F1}&quot;);&#10;        sb.AppendLine($&quot;Alloc: {totalMemory / (1024 * 1024)}MB&quot;);&#10;        sb.AppendLine($&quot;Reserved: {usedMemory / (1024 * 1024)}MB&quot;);&#10;&#10;        GUI.Label(new Rect(10, 10, 300, 100), sb.ToString(), style);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ResetStats()&#10;    {&#10;        minFPS = float.MaxValue;&#10;        maxFPS = 0;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PerformanceOverlay : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private bool showOverlay = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private int fontSize = 14;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float deltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float updateInterval = 0.5f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float lastUpdateTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int frameCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float currentFPS;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float minFPS = float.MaxValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float maxFPS;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly StringBuilder sb = new(256);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GUIStyle style;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        deltaTime += (Time.unscaledDeltaTime - deltaTime) * 0.1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        frameCount++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Time.unscaledTime - lastUpdateTime >= updateInterval)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentFPS = frameCount / (Time.unscaledTime - lastUpdateTime);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            frameCount = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lastUpdateTime = Time.unscaledTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (currentFPS &#x3C; minFPS &#x26;&#x26; currentFPS > 0) minFPS = currentFPS;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (currentFPS > maxFPS) maxFPS = currentFPS;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnGUI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!showOverlay) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        style ??= new GUIStyle(GUI.skin.label)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            fontSize = fontSize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            fontStyle = FontStyle.Bold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        style.normal.textColor = currentFPS &#x3C; 30 ? Color.red :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                  currentFPS &#x3C; 60 ? Color.yellow : Color.green;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float msec = deltaTime * 1000f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        long totalMemory = UnityEngine.Profiling.Profiler.GetTotalAllocatedMemoryLong();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        long usedMemory = UnityEngine.Profiling.Profiler.GetTotalReservedMemoryLong();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.Clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.AppendLine($\"FPS: {currentFPS:F1} ({msec:F1}ms)\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.AppendLine($\"Min: {minFPS:F1} / Max: {maxFPS:F1}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.AppendLine($\"Alloc: {totalMemory / (1024 * 1024)}MB\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.AppendLine($\"Reserved: {usedMemory / (1024 * 1024)}MB\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GUI.Label(new Rect(10, 10, 300, 100), sb.ToString(), style);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ResetStats()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        minFPS = float.MaxValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        maxFPS = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 性能分析工作流&#10;        A[发现卡顿] --&gt; B[Profiler CPU 定位热点]&#10;        B --&gt; C{瓶颈类型}&#10;        C --&gt;|CPU 逻辑| D[优化算法/缓存]&#10;        C --&gt;|GC 分配| E[Memory 模块定位]&#10;        C --&gt;|渲染| F[Frame Debugger 分析]&#10;        C --&gt;|物理| G[Physics Profiler]&#10;        D --&gt; H[验证优化效果]&#10;        E --&gt; H&#10;        F --&gt; H&#10;        G --&gt; H&#10;        H --&gt; I{达标}&#10;        I --&gt;|否| B&#10;        I --&gt;|是| J[完成]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 性能分析工作流\n        A[发现卡顿] --&gt; B[Profiler CPU 定位热点]\n        B --&gt; C{瓶颈类型}\n        C --&gt;|CPU 逻辑| D[优化算法/缓存]\n        C --&gt;|GC 分配| E[Memory 模块定位]\n        C --&gt;|渲染| F[Frame Debugger 分析]\n        C --&gt;|物理| G[Physics Profiler]\n        D --&gt; H[验证优化效果]\n        E --&gt; H\n        F --&gt; H\n        G --&gt; H\n        H --&gt; I{达标}\n        I --&gt;|否| B\n        I --&gt;|是| J[完成]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((性能分析工具))&#10;    CPU Profiler&#10;      方法级耗时分析&#10;      BeginSample 自定义标记&#10;      Timeline 多线程分析&#10;      真机远程连接&#10;    Memory 分析&#10;      GC 分配追踪&#10;      NonAlloc API&#10;      StringBuilder 复用&#10;      缓存引用&#10;    Frame Debugger&#10;      Draw Call 逐步分析&#10;      批处理断裂定位&#10;      Overdraw 检测&#10;    自定义监控&#10;      实时 FPS 面板&#10;      内存使用展示&#10;      运行时诊断\">mindmap\n  root((性能分析工具))\n    CPU Profiler\n      方法级耗时分析\n      BeginSample 自定义标记\n      Timeline 多线程分析\n      真机远程连接\n    Memory 分析\n      GC 分配追踪\n      NonAlloc API\n      StringBuilder 复用\n      缓存引用\n    Frame Debugger\n      Draw Call 逐步分析\n      批处理断裂定位\n      Overdraw 检测\n    自定义监控\n      实时 FPS 面板\n      内存使用展示\n      运行时诊断</pre><ul>\n<li>性能优化的第一原则是&quot;先测量后优化&quot;，盲目优化往往事倍功半</li>\n<li>CPU Profiler 的 Self 和 Total 时间区分方法自身和子调用的耗时</li>\n<li>Memory 模块配合 NonAlloc API 和 StringBuilder 消除运行时 GC 分配</li>\n<li>Frame Debugger 逐步展示 Draw Call，精准定位批处理断裂原因</li>\n<li>自定义性能监控面板提供运行时实时诊断，减少对 Profiler 窗口的依赖</li>\n<li>始终在真机上进行最终性能验证，编辑器内的分析结果存在额外开销误差</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能分析工具","id":"性能分析工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Profiler CPU 模块","id":"profiler-cpu-模块"},{"level":2,"text":"Profiler Memory 与 GC 分析","id":"profiler-memory-与-gc-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"Frame Debugger 渲染分析","id":"frame-debugger-渲染分析"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义性能监控面板","id":"自定义性能监控面板"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"UI 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-optimization"},"next":{"title":"渲染优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-performance/rendering-optimization"}}